-The tuning round for Hollis Piano Services. `data/pianos.json` lists every client: who they are, their town, the piano (`grand` or `upright`) and the day it was last tuned.
+The tuning round for Hollis Piano Services. `data/pianos.json` lists every client: who they are, their town, the piano (`grand` or `upright`), the day it was last tuned, and how often their contract says it is tuned (`quarterly` or `six-monthly`).
 
 ## Round
 
-The round lists the pianos due a tuning: any piano last tuned 182 days or more before the day of the round.
+The round lists the pianos due a tuning. A piano falls due three or six months after its last tuning, as its contract says, on the same date of the month, or on the last day of the month when that month is shorter: a piano tuned on 31 August is due on 28 February. Quarterly pianos are marked.
+
+How often a piano is tuned is agreed with the client and recorded in its contract; the round never changes it.
 
